      "content": "i mean i get that but i feel 100% normal right now. like my vision is perfect and my hand is fine. going to the er seems like a huge overreaction if nothing is actually wrong. couldn't i just take some aspirin and keep an eye on it for tonight? i dont want to deal with the hospital if it was just a fluke.",
